### ===============================
### 5. 마이페이지 (MypageController)
### ===============================

### 5-1. 내 정보 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
X-User-Id: 1

### 5-2. 내 정보 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "홍길동수정",
  "phoneNumber": "010-9999-8888"
}

### 5-3. 회원 탈퇴
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
X-User-Id: 1

### 5-4. 비밀번호 변경
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/password
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "NewPassword1234!",
  "newPassword": "Test1234!"
}

### 5-5. 내 권한 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/roles
X-User-Id: 1

### 5-6. 내 연동 소셜 계정 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/oauths
X-User-Id: 1

### 5-7. 소셜 계정 신규 연동
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/oauths/google
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "여기에_google_authorization_code_입력"
}

### 5-8. 소셜 계정 연동 해제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/oauths/1
X-User-Id: 1